  "headline": "FDA's shortage list shows amoxicillin and clavulanate potassium has been posted since 2022-10-28; NuCare and Asclemed plants have VAI/OAI histories but no current FDA cause is stated",
  "headline_cites": ["D7", "E8", "E14"],
  "sentences": [
    {
      "text": "FDA's shortage list shows amoxicillin and clavulanate potassium has been posted since 2022-10-28 and remains listed as of 2026-10-21, a duration of 48 months.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "NuCare Pharmaceuticals, Inc. (FEI 3003294404) is a registered relabel plant for this product and its most recent FDA inspection ended 2020-01-10 with a VAI classification.",
      "cites": ["E10", "E8"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Asclemed USA Inc. DBA ENOVACHEM (FEI 3001452204) is another registered relabel plant and received an OAI classification after an inspection ending 2018-09-27.",
      "cites": ["E16", "E14"]
    },
    {
      "text": "FDA has not stated a cause for the shortage in the provided records.",
      "cites": ["D7"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Corvale East holds 294 units at 15.3 units per day (19 days on hand) and Corvale General holds 823 units at 30.8 units per day (27 days on hand).",
      "cites": ["D1", "D2"]
    },
    {
      "text": "The rule-ranked option is to buy from Hikma Pharmaceuticals USA Inc., which is not on FDA's shortage list today and operates plants in Jordan (2INAMOXU24N-E and 2INAMOXU12N).",
      "cites": ["D4"]
    },
    {
      "text": "Alternate manufacturers not on the shortage list include Sandoz Inc. and Teva Pharmaceuticals USA, Inc., which should also be checked for availability.",
      "cites": ["D5", "D6"]
    }
  ]
}
